        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Untitled Document</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #f4f0e7;\n      color: #282521;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 0 12px 0 13px;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 11%, rgba(110,85,55,.055), transparent 20%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 84% 72%, rgba(105,80,48,.045), transparent 27%),\n        #f8f5ed;\n    }\n    .line {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 27px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 27px;\n      letter-spacing: .1px;\n    }\n    .topcut { margin-top: -9px; }\n    .indent1 { padding-left: 28px; }\n    .indent2 { padding-left: 47px; }\n    .red {\n      color: #8f1841;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    .note {\n      position: absolute;\n      color: #8f1841;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 16px;\n      transform: rotate(-8deg);\n      z-index: 3;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .bottom {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 285px;\n      margin-top: 0;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -13px;\n      top: 8px;\n      width: 300px;\n      height: 256px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 9px;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #5c554e;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(131,160,177,.34), rgba(244,239,224,.08) 48%, rgba(63,58,45,.18)),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(16deg, rgba(71,61,48,.08) 0 1px, transparent 1px 7px);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(79,67,51,.25);\n    }\n    .side-text {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 289px;\n      top: 0;\n      width: 238px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 27px;\n    }\n    .side-text div { height: 27px; white-space: nowrap; }\n    .below {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      top: 243px;\n      width: 520px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 27px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"line topcut indent2\">[illegible]很爽朗的接：只是想吃粥呀，可床面就八份饭，[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent1\">饿，也不耐烦，不过因为一进灶房，就听到那锅中咕噜又像是在</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">喘的声音，因好奇而急于想尝尝这奇怪的东西罢了。</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2\">“妈，妈，等一下我要吃三碗！我们只准大哥吃一碗。大哥同</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">爹都吃不甜的，我们俩光吃甜的也行……妈，妈，你吃三碗我也</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">吃三碗，大哥同爹只准各吃一碗。——共八碗，是吗？”<span class=\"red\">话音甚畅</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2\">“是啊！<span class=\"red\">好</span>笙说得好。</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2\">“要不然我吃三碗半，你就吃两碗半……”<span class=\"red\">一碗饭依几儿煮得够饱。</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line indent2\">“噢……”锅内又叮当一响，八儿回过头来，也不过是看到</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">胀淡臭气往上一冲而已！才又吓人心！糟糕啦，粥锅着火[illegible]啦。</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent1\">“锅中的一切，对八儿来说，只能猜想：栗子已稀烂到认不清楚</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">了吧，饭豆会煮得浑身肿胀了吧，花生仁吃来总该是面面的了！枣</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">子必大了三四倍——要是真的干红枣也有那么大，那就妙极了！糖</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">若放多了，它会起锅巴……”<span class=\"red\">“妈，妈，你把我起来看看吧！”</span>于是</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">妈妈就如八儿所求的把他抱了起来。<span class=\"red\">她也向人们说话</span></div>\n\n    <span class=\"note\" style=\"left:165px; top:153px;\">同一碗饭量过大</span>\n    <span class=\"note\" style=\"left:362px; top:164px;\">跟妈妈问你还不想多些</span>\n    <span class=\"note\" style=\"left:185px; top:179px;\">甜甜的</span>\n    <span class=\"note\" style=\"left:164px; top:213px;\">声音</span>\n    <span class=\"note\" style=\"left:189px; top:228px;\">还没煮呢</span>\n    <span class=\"note\" style=\"left:294px; top:239px;\">热锅</span>\n    <span class=\"note\" style=\"left:307px; top:393px;\">末锅内把她抱起来的好奇。</span>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: mother in blue holding a young child beside cooking pots, bottom-left]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"side-text\">\n        <div>“唉……”他像异样般起来了。锅中的一切已进了他的眼中。</div>\n        <div>“这不能不说是喜个怪呀，要子跌进锅里，不久就得粉碎，那是他</div>\n        <div>知道的。他曾想过跌进煮黄</div>\n        <div>鸡锅子里的一样栗子，不</div>\n        <div>久就融掉了。饭豆煮得肿</div>\n        <div>胀，那也是往常<span class=\"red\">熬粥</span>时常见</div>\n        <div>的事。花生仁脱了它的红外</div>\n        <div>套，这是不消说的事。锅</div>\n        <div>巴，正是睡下锅边成一圈。</div>\n        <div><span class=\"red\">总之</span>，一切都成了如他所猜。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"below\">\n        <span class=\"red\">虽说有粥；即将合预想也有些儿意料之外。只是煮好的饭色并不佳的</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
